      "item": "theoreticalsciences:tesla_coil",
      "title": "Tesla Coil",
      "text": "A resonant transformer: a spark-gap primary ringing in tune with a tall secondary steps a few kilovolts up to millions, and the toroid throws arcs metres long.$(br2)$(thing)Tier 2$() machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(thing)Made on the Extreme Assembly Table$() (it is also a crafting table). The recipe pages at the end of this entry - and JEI - show the pattern."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Tune the primary - its capacitance and the turns tapped - to ring at the secondary's 159 kHz. In tune, the voltage steps up as \u221a(C\u2081/C\u2082) and the arcs grow a metre for every 700 kV. Stand clear: anyone within six blocks of a running coil gets struck."
    },
